# Agent skills & local specs (local only — never pushed to GitHub)
#
# NOTE: .uihub-agent/ is intentionally NOT ignored. It is the project knowledge
# base (architecture, API, deployment, runtime and conflict contracts) and must
# be tracked so those contracts live with the code. Do not re-add it here.
#
# NOTE: .github/ is intentionally NOT ignored. CI workflows are project
# configuration: an untracked workflow means every agent reads a CI definition
# that does not exist for anyone else, and the pipeline cannot be reviewed in a
# pull request. Removed in Phase 6 (agent.md 6.9/6.10).
#
# .agents/, .claude/ and .opencode/ remain ignored. They hold personal local
# tooling and skills, not shared project contracts. Confirmed by owner in Phase 6.
.agents/
.opencode/
.claude/
component-specs/

